Purpose of Position

The Business Insights Analyst Associate combines analytical knowledge and aptitude with adaptability, practicality, and a strong ability to communicate. The purpose is to deliver exceptional analytical insights and solutions to challenges throughout NetJets.

This role is responsible for gathering, managing and consolidating accurate information to provide to the business within the diverse areas that belong to the Business Insights & Analytics department, executing analysis measuring the business performance.

This role will help define solutions and support change adoption to improve forecasting performance, cross functional communication, and integrated planning.

Tasks And Responsibilities


Develop and implement company dashboard reports, analytical modelling and visualizations to facilitate the monitoring of the business, allowing to quickly identify and act on issues and seize opportunities;
Assist to identify key business indicators to enhance the understanding of key business stakeholders of business needs by the distribution and creation of reporting, analysis, mining, visualization, dashboards, whilst proposing solutions to business concerns;
Provide data and create timely, relevant, and accurate analyses of operational and business data and processes at the level of fidelity required for the diverse areas of the business;
Provides expertise in statistics, data visualization, machine learning, mathematical optimization, simulation, or another analytical specialty;
Learn new tools and techniques as needed to produce the best possible results;
Perform analysis of both strategic and tactical business and operational questions while working independently, pragmatically, and with reliance on creative analytical curiosity;
Collaborate with business partners to analytically explore business and operational problems. Gather and act to resolve operational issues through increasing business acumen;
Help simplify complex analytical models/insights/solutions in presentations for Executive Leadership Team;
